  k_lib_lint: ["Per-entry check on parse (secret, injection, unknown fields, budget). No tiered array of checks over the layer and no sorted report; it throws or drops."],
  k_lib_notify: ["mountOutbound posts an https webhook only when events.webhook_url is set (off by default) for accepted/blocked/canceled tasks; mounted at server.ts:451. Missing: periodic pulse and a waiting-for-owner event."],
  k_lib_profilewriter: ["Prompt only tells the agent to use lane-plan profile --set; this repo has no writer and no secret refusal there (credential redaction exists in src/rooms/anamnesis/model.ts:95)."],
