  k_wp_bounce: ["Two internal critics of different models converge over three rounds. It is a review not an optional refinement by an external tool, and the phase driver never calls it."],
  k_wp_closed: ["setState does not guard. plan() refuses a closed phase, but returnTo sets a closed phase back to active (state closed to active), so a closed phase can be reopened and replanned."],
