  k_wp_patterns: ["Pattern finding is a rubric line and a PATTERNS.md read-first path; no pattern-mapper capability or step, nothing produces PATTERNS.md."],
  k_wp_research: ["Research is only a line in the planning rubric text and a RESEARCH.md read-first path; no flag or question decides it, no skip-research answer, no research step runs."],
  k_wp_state: ["STATE and roadmap marks are written only when the phase closes (roadmap row [x], stage closed). No mark for planning completion or waves."],
  k_wp_validation: ["validationGaps lints a submitted plan for pieces whose checks only test file existence. No validation-strategy step before the plan, no VALIDATION.md written."],
