  k_wr_commit: ["writeDocs commits phase documents (UAT, SUMMARY, ROADMAP, STATE, SECURITY) but no REVIEW.md. Code review writes reports/review-<run>.md via fs.write, uncommitted."],
  k_wr_prepass: ["Only the scope step (diff list, prune filter, level by file count) precedes the model. Structural cheap checks exist only for the plan critic (critique-runs.ts:221-254), not for code review."],
