  k_ws_post: ["Post-ship hooks exist only as a sentence in the open_pr agent prompt (run .agents/planning/hooks/post-ship*.md via lane-plan). No code resolves or runs active capability steps at ship:post; it relies on the agent and an external tool."],
  k_ws_review: ["ship has no review step and no configured external review command. code-review exists as a separate optional workflow but ship does not call it."],
