  m_ac_codex_home: ["Fresh CODEX_HOME per task exists, but auth.json is symlinked to the shared login, not copied, and no removal of the home after the task was found."],
  m_ac_identity_probe: ["Probe checks sudo reaches the worker user (also lp-worker-user.sh check). Missing: checking the worker cannot reach the owner's secrets. Capability sweep only probes models."],
