  m_cfg_max_turns: ["SESSION_MAX_TURNS=5 caps feedback turns of a writer session (a constant). Not the 80-turn worker ceiling, no settings key, not passed on the worker command line."],
  m_cfg_pipeline_off: ["The conveyor switch exists and persists in kv, but the default is ON (off only after an explicit set). Card says it ships off."],
  m_confirm_later: ["Stop confirmation waits up to 30 s inline; start-up resume re-observes cancel_requested attempts once. No re-check at 30 s and 120 s after start; periodic reconcile skips resume."],
  m_ctl_exit: ["Status exits 0 door answers, 1 down, 2 unknown (systemd cannot be asked). 2 does not mean a refusal a flag would lift; no force flag exists."],
  m_ctl_killed: ["SIGKILL exists only in lift() for a hung server, done at once with no graceful attempt. The stop path reports no 'stopped hard' outcome after a timeout."],
  m_ctl_lift_cmd: ["install_unit picks LaunchAgent/systemd/user unit/cron for the watchdog itself. lift() is systemd-only and the restart command does not share it. No single per-platform lift command."],
