  m_green: ["poolHealth is green while at least one provider breaker key is not open (held.length < snapshot.length). Card says green only when no enabled worker is blocked."],
  m_gt_authed: ["the core checks the caller only when the owner sets BB_VK_OWNER_AUTH; the plugin adds no caller check of its own (owner decision 2026-10-08)"],
  m_hs_toggle: ["saveProjectSetting is the generic setting write. Per-stage *.enabled switches exist, but no per-writer profile toggle that changes only enabled."],
