  m_lifecycle: ["hideRecord handles superseded and expired only. Erase is deleteMemoryRecord in store.ts; no revoke or archive status."],
  m_lint: ["Foreign fields, empty text and secrets are refused at write. There is no corpus lint that flags existing records lacking a pipeline trace."],
  m_mc_poll: ["pollPeers runs on a 5-minute cron and reads BB's host list (connected flag). It does not ask each peer for its board; failure is caught and logged."],
  m_mc_snapshot: ["Snapshot has name, online, times, and offline lines say 'last seen N min ago'. But it is saved in persistent kv, not memory-only, and never pruned."],
